+- [Precision Neuroscience Receives FDA Clearance for High-Resolution Cortical Electrode Array — GlobeNewswire](https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/04/17/3063418/0/en/Precision-Neuroscience-Receives-FDA-Clearance-for-High-Resolution-Cortical-Electrode-Array.html)
+- [Precision Neuroscience receives FDA clearance — MedTech Dive](https://www.medtechdive.com/news/precision-neuroscience-brain-implant-fda-cleared/745913/)
+- [The current state of electrocorticography-based BCIs — Miller, Hermes & Staff, Neurosurgical Focus 2020 — PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32610290/)
+- [Electrocorticography-based brain computer interface — the Seattle experience — Leuthardt et al., IEEE TNSRE 2006 — PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16792292/)
