+- [Nalu Expands MRI-Conditional Labeling — company release](https://nalumed.com/nalu-expands-mri-conditional-labeling-for-peripheral-nerve-stimulation-with-fda-clearance-for-whole-body-mri/)
+- [Nalu Medical Announces First Enrollment of COMFORT-2 Trial — company release](https://nalumed.com/comfort-2-peripheral-nerve-stimulation-enrollment/)
